== group: aggregation of individual judgments (AIJ)
  geometric AIJ reciprocal: True; arithmetic AIJ reciprocal: False
  opposite judgments 3 and 1/3 -> geometric mean 1.000 ("equal"), the disagreement is lost
  RGMM(geometric AIJ) = normalized geometric mean of individual RGMM weights: 5.6e-17
